# Testing & formatting

- Format with root Prettier (`.prettierrc`). Do not skip husky / lint-staged (`--no-verify`) in normal work.
- When changing Nest auth, ACL, gems catalog, or itinerary write paths, add or update `apps/api-server` unit specs and light e2e under `test/`.
- Follow skill `testing-format` for commands and patterns.
- Keep MockLLM chat transport intact; do not add Next Route Handlers in `client-app`.
